"All binary numbers are in network byte order.  In a repository using the "
"traditional SHA-1, checksums and object IDs (object names) mentioned below "
"are all computed using SHA-1.  Similarly, in SHA-256 repositories, these "
"values are computed using SHA-256.  Version 2 is described here unless "
"stated otherwise."
